-   entry .commandlineGit   the backend which runs the `git` command
-       A `Git.Backend^{loggable, caps.any}` built as `Commandline(command)` from the
-       `Commandline.Command`, `WorkingDirectory`, `Environment` and `Commandline.Event is
-       Loggable` in scope: so import `gitCommands.searchpathGitCommand` (or bind a command),
-       `workingDirectories.javaBaseWorkingDirectory`, `environments.javaBaseEnvironment` and a
-       logging policy alongside it.
+   entry .commandlineGit   бэкенд, который запускает команду `git`
+       `Git.Backend^{loggable, caps.any}`, построенный как `Commandline(command)` из
+       `Commandline.Command`, `WorkingDirectory`, `Environment` и `Commandline.Event is
+       Loggable` из области видимости: поэтому вместе с ним импортируются
+       `gitCommands.searchpathGitCommand` (или связывается команда),
+       `workingDirectories.javaBaseWorkingDirectory`, `environments.javaBaseEnvironment` и
